<item>
  <title>Hospital Glucose Meter Removal: Nova Biomedical Removes StatStrip Glucose Hospital Meter Systems</title>
  <link>http://www.fda.gov/medical-devices/medical-device-recalls-and-early-alerts/hospital-glucose-meter-removal-nova-biomedical-removes-statstrip-glucose-hospital-meter-systems</link>
  <description>Software update for StatStrip Glucose Hospital Meter Systems due to the potential for glucose results to be assigned to the incorrect patient.</description>
